findings.suggested_fix:
Avoid adding units or conversions that were not in the authoritative English text. Either remove the added metric conversions or ensure they are presented as parenthetical editorial notes. Suggested replacement examples (preserve HTML):
- replace "sju miles (ca. 11 km)" with "sju miles";
- replace "60 miles (ca. 97 km)" with "60 miles";
- replace "60 miles unna (ca. 97 km)" with "60 miles unna".
If metric conversions are required by publishing policy, mark them clearly as editorial additions.
